        51.276031494140625
      ],
      "text": "for both current TB and LTBI (including treatment). Thus, it is imperative",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        54.273040771484375,
        408.0426940917969,
        63.273040771484375
      ],
      "text": "that HIV counselling, testing and, when appropriate, referral for special -",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.9191131591797,
        66.27005004882812,
        408.1060485839844,
        75.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "ized care be offered to contacts, especially (but not exclusively) in areas",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.97311401367188,
        78.26705932617188,
        225.71214294433594,
        87.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "of high HIV prevalence.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.94111251831055,
        108.09336853027344,
        408.1239318847656,
        117.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 5 It is recommended that all household contacts of an index case who is",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.99111938476562,
        120.26107788085938,
        324.5320739746094,
        129.26107788085938
      ],
      "text": "a PLHIV should be counselled and tested for HIV.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0001220703125,
        138.26107788085938,
        333.2635803222656,
        147.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "Strong recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.06460571289062,
        168.27304077148438,
        165.45860290527344,
        177.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "Remark",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        180.27603149414062,
        408.2409973144531,
        189.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "Because household contacts of a PLHIV index case are more likely also",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1171112060547,
        192.27304077148438,
        408.2497253417969,
        201.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "to be HIV positive and because PLHIV who are contacts should be",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.12611389160156,
        204.27005004882812,
        408.6996154785156,
        213.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "managed differently from contacts who do not have HIV infection,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.13511657714844,
        216.26705932617188,
        408.24969482421875,
        225.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "household contacts should have counselling and testing for HIV",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.12611389160156,
        228.26406860351562,
        172.81011962890625,
        237.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "infection.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.08510971069336,
        258.0903625488281,
        410.19378662109375,
        267.2610778808594
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 6 It is recommended that all household and close contacts of people",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1081085205078,
        270.2580871582031,
        408.18280029296875,
        279.2760925292969
      ],
      "text": "with TB who have symptoms compatible with active TB should receive",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.05882263183594,
        282.2728576660156,
        391.3705749511719,
        291.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "counselling and testing for HIV as part of their clinical evaluation.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0678253173828,
        300.2728576660156,
        352.49072265625,
        309.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "Conditional recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0768280029297,
        330.2698669433594,
        165.47084045410156,
        339.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "Remark",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        342.27606201171875,
        408.21368408203125,
        351.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation is consistent with existing recommendations",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.08111572265625,
        354.2730712890625,
        408.0700988769531,
        363.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "that people suspected of having TB should have counselling and testing",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.93711853027344,
        366.27008056640625,
        218.70115661621094,
        375.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "for HIV infection (39).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.90511703491211,
        396.09637451171875,
        408.474853515625,
        405.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 7 PLHIV who are household or close contacts of people with TB and who,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.91012573242188,
        408.26409912109375,
        408.0879211425781,
        417.26409912109375
      ],
      "text": "after an appropriate clinical evaluation, are found not to have active TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.9551239013672,
        420.2611083984375,
        369.1631164550781,
        429.2611083984375
      ],
      "text": "should be treated for presumed LTBI as per WHO guidelines.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.96412658691406,
        438.2611083984375,
        318.6482238769531,
        447.27911376953125
      ],
      "text": "Strong recommendation, high-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.06521606445312,
        468.2729187011719,
        170.43621826171875,
        477.2729187011719
      ],
      "text": "Remark 1",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        480.2760314941406,
        408.18695068359375,
        489.2760314941406
      ],
      "text": "HIV-positive household or close contacts who are adults or adolescents",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.05410766601562,
        492.2730407714844,
        408.35809326171875,
        501.2730407714844
      ],
      "text": "and whose clinical evaluation suggests that they are unlikely to have",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.23410034179688,
        504.2700500488281,
        408.3847961425781,
        513.2700805664062
      ],
      "text": "active TB should receive preventive treatment with isoniazid at 300",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.26109313964844,
        516.2670288085938,
        408.3128662109375,
        525.2670288085938
      ],
      "text": "mg/day for at least 6 months (4). It is conditionally recommended that",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.31509399414062,
        528.2640380859375,
        408.4659118652344,
        537.2640380859375
      ],
      "text": "the duration of isoniazid preventive treatment of PLHIV with no active",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.3420867919922,
        540.2610473632812,
        269.0020446777344,
        549.2610473632812
      ],
      "text": "TB be prolonged to 36 months (4).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.3330841064453,
        570.2670288085938,
        172.01809692382812,
        579.2670288085938
      ],
      "text": "Remark 2",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        582.2760620117188,
        408.1687927246094,
        591.2760620117188
      ],
      "text": "HIV-positive household or close contacts who are children with no",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.04510498046875,
        594.2730712890625,
        408.1510314941406,
        603.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "active TB should receive preventive treatment with isoniazid at a dose",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.027099609375,
        606.2700805664062,
        301.1860656738281,
        615.2700805664062
      ],
      "text": "of 10 mg/kg body weight for 6 months (4).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        226.17221069335938,
        651.97265625,
        233.04971313476562,
        659.47265625
      ],
